OL,3,GNEWSATaxi driver injured in knifepoint
OL,4,Arobbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Ftaxi driver suffered "nasty injuries"
OL,8,Fin a knifepoint robbery, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to the Wingfield
OL,12,FAvenue area of Worksop at about 04:30
OL,13,FGMT on Wednesday after the driver
OL,14,Freported the attack.
OL,16,FNottinghamshire Police said the male
OL,17,Fdriver, who was "new to the job", had
OL,18,Fpicked up two men in a pre-arranged
OL,19,Fbooking in Newcastle Avenue in the town
OL,20,Fat 04:25.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
