OL,3,GNEWSATaxi driver injured in knifepoint
OL,4,Arobbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen they reached Wingfield Avenue,
OL,7,Fclose to its junctions with Primrose
OL,8,FWay and Ravenscourt, one of the men
OL,9,Freached towards the driver with a knife
OL,10,Fand demanded money, officers said, with
OL,11,Fthe victim suffering injuries to his
OL,12,Fhand when he grabbed the knife in self
OL,13,Fdefence.
